 aint is used to create abstract designs by pouring colours over an object.
 \nUsing this technique\, participants will create their own one-of-a-kind 
 coaster.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this
  form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librarie
 s Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be u
