DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260808T153000
UID:6a4e69c1fb18bf3d00beedc4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have fun learning a new instrument - the ukulele! This worksho
 p will cover fundamentals of ukulele playing: the parts of a ukulele\, tun
 ing\, strumming patterns\, and some basic chords. By the end of this class
 \, you'll have learned the skills you need to start playing your first son
 gs on the ukulele. Beginner friendly\, no previous experience is necessary
 .
