DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260815T113000
UID:6a3bdcab86636e3d00503daf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're just setting pen to paper\, or you're a seasone
 d writer\, join us at our bi-weekly Writers Group for inspiration and enco
 uragement in a supportive\, positive environment. We'll warm up with a sho
 rt writing prompt and then you'll have the opportunity to share a portion 
 of your work for feedback from the group.\nThis is a drop-in group.
LOCATION:Gerrard/Ashdale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3bdcab86636e3d00503daf
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Finding Recovery Through Exercise Skills and Hope (FRESH)
