DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260725T123000
UID:6a3d4bc0c7d3cd580062bfff@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Curious about how to use AI can in pursuing career goals? Whet
 her you're exploring career paths\, writing a resume or preparing for inte
 rviews\, this practical\, interactive workshop will demonstrate how to use
  AI tools to support these activities. Participants will leave with prompt
 s and strategies and an understanding of how to use AI effectively and res
 ponsibly in their job search and career exploration.\nNo registration requ
 ired.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3d4bc0c7d3cd580062bfff
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:How to Use Gamification to Achieve Business Objectives - for Found
 ers and Newcomers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260808T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260808T120000
UID:6a3d4c47296ea565de2eadeb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This interactive workshop equips startup and newcomer founders
  to harness gamification for business goals by influencing human behavior.
  Participants will learn core principles\, the 'Circle' framework\, and st
 rategies to overcome challenges using game mechanics.\nA relevant case stu
 dy and collaborative discussion help craft tailored solutions\, followed b
 y a Q&A to wrap-up the workshop for deeper insights.\nNo registration requ
 ired. Space is limited.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3d4c47296ea565de2eadeb
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
