 y\, July 31:\nUniversity Settlement\nFriday\, August 28:\nHF Care – Asia
 n Mental Health and Well-Being\nFriday\, September 25\n:\nTPL staff (Indig
 enous Initiatives) and WoodGreen\nFriday\, October 30:\nVolunteer T.O.\nFr
 iday\, November 27:\nOsteoporosis Canada\nSnacks and refreshments are prov
 ided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the progr
 am.
