DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T150000
UID:6a2b299bdcc1022f00394af6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This\n program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn
  new skills\, and \nhave fun. It involves peer-led group activities which 
 can include crafts\, games\,\n walking\, yoga\, and more. Meet new folks\
 , build social connections\, and tell us\n about programs and services you
  would like to see in the neighbourhood!\nJoin us at the crafts & games ta
 ble\, or for a community walk (weather permitting).\nVisit with a therapy 
 dog!\nHippie is here on June 15\, 29 + July 13\, 27 + August 10\, 24.\nOzz
 y is here June 22 + July 6\, 20 + August 17\, 31.\nSnacks and refreshments
  are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at
  the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Cent
 re's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2b299bdcc1022f00394af6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
