DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun-filled afternoon of Lithophane making! 
 Discover the art of creating beautiful translucent images using light and 
 shadow. This hands-on workshop will guide you through the process of makin
 g your very own unique Lithophane. No experience necessary -all materials 
 will be provided.\nPlease bring a photo that you would like to turn into a
  lithophane.
