 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all part
 icipants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.\nAugust 19th:
  Newcomer Women
