DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T113000
UID:6a57d6870e562e28009a1326@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For people who have basic internet skills but want to learn ab
 out the different online shopping websites and Apps. We will cover searchi
 ng and researching goods & services online\, tips for online purchasing\, 
 the process of making online purchases\, how to stay safe when shopping on
 line\, methods of payment for online purchases. Resource handout provided.
 \nRegister online.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informati
 on on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Publi
 c Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will
