BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artist Circle: A Take on Water
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T190000
UID:6a54fad2cca66c2f00a31973@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive experience of watercolour painting 
 and atmospheric soul sounds. Lore Inc. is a Toronto based singer-songwrite
 r offering streams of music from her newest project\nA Take On Water\n. Lo
 re Inc reminds us that “water is the life source of all things”. This 
 artist circle appreciates that source and inspires the flow of your creati
 ve expression through shades of blue in a range of hues.\nPainting supplie
 s are provided.\nMusic on IG\n@lore.incmusic\n& YT\nLoreInc. - Topic
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Founder's Room\, floor 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a54fad2cca66c2f00a31973
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
