DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T153000
UID:6a592aa3e5d5fbb123bf127b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Understand the basic concept of Excel Macros\, be able to crea
 te a macro\, view/edit a macro\, and run/execute a macro\, including using
  shortcut key to macros. Basic Excel Knowledge and skills required.\nIf th
 e above class date does not fit for your busy schedule\, you may book an a
 ppointment with a librarian on one-on-one basis.\nInformation Collection N
 otice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto 
 Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, a
 nd 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program registra
 tion\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles yo
 ur information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n
 \, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, the Learning Centre
