BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adult Paint Step-by-Step
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260812T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260812T143000
UID:6a593e1d9943bdf31e9f65d7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Unleash Your Inner Artist with Acrylic Painting!\nJoin us for 
 a fun-filled afternoon where you get the chance to express you creativity.
  We will be recreating a beautiful acrylic painting all while meeting new 
 people. This is a beginner friendly workshop and no matter your skill leve
 l\, you’ll have a blast!\nAll supplies provided.\nPlease note:\nacrylics
  require proper drying time\, all masterpieces will need to remain in the 
 branch to dry. Participants will be able to pick up their artwork during r
 egular library hours beginning\nFriday\, August 14.\nNote: Registered part
 icipant spaces will be held for 10 minutes\, after which drop-in participa
 nts will be allowed.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informa
 tion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pub
 lic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wi
 ll only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluati
 on. Questions about how the library handles your information can be direct
 ed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge 
 Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis\, Room 1\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a593e1d9943bdf31e9f65d7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
