DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261017T153000
UID:6a5bce947b79214226a97f50@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Open to adult writers of all experience levels. Monthly meetin
 g with writing peers to work on developing your creative skills. Work on a
 nd share your printed writing (Maximum 500 words)\, hear others’ thought
 s\, learn some new writing tips\, and participate in creative writing exer
 cises and activities.\nRegistration required. Drop-ins welcome if space pe
 rmits.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
 orm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries 
 Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be use
 d for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions 
 about how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerli
 ne staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toron
 to ON M4W 2G8.\nMore dates to be announced.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5bce947b79214226a97f50
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
