 k we will be decorating coasters using the diamond painting technique. Wit
 h a special applicator pen\, wax\, and tiny\, faceted resin "diamonds"\, p
 articipants will create a sparkling\, functional coaster. Craft is beginne
 r friendly. All adults and seniors are welcome!\nRegistration is required 
