BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Northern District Book Club—Evenings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T200000
UID:6a5f86437b79214226aa1374@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a friendly\, spirited discussion of a different bo
 ok on the third Wednesday of each month. We read an eclectic mix of mostly
  contemporary fiction.\nThere is also an afternoon session to discuss the 
 same book on the second Wednesday of each month at 2:00 p.m.  You are we
 lcome at either or both!\nNote:\nno August meeting\nSeptember 16\, 2026:\n
 Orbital\nby Samantha Harvey\nOctober 21\, 2026:\nMaybe You Should Talk to 
 Someone\nby Lori Gottlieb\nNovember 18\, 2026:\nStone Yard Devotional\nby 
 Charlotte Wood\nDecember 16\, 2026:\nPerfection\nby Lorenzo Patronico
LOCATION:Northern District\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5f86437b79214226aa1374
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Movies From Around the World
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T200000
UID:69bc63824dacf581ff8330e6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every second Monday of the month (unless specified oth
 erwise) as we bring the world to you through the power of cinema! Beginnin
 g with a small introduction\, we will be hosting screenings from various m
 ovies from around the world\, so we hope to see you there!\nAugust 10th:\n
 City of God\n(Brazil)\; Runtime: 2h10m\; Rating: R\nSeptember 14th:\nBoy\n
 (New Zealand)\; Runtime: 1h27m\; Rating: 14A\nOctober 19th:\nOldboy\n(Sout
 h Korea)\; Runtime: 2h\; Rating: R\nNovember 9th:\nKung fu hustle\n(China/
 Hong Kong)\; Runtime: 1h39m\; Rating: 14A
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Basement program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bc63824dacf581ff8330e6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
