 variety of trees\n.\nJoin the\nCity of Toronto Urban Forestry\nteam\nto ex
 plore the natural world on a local neighbourhood tour. Learn how to recogn
 ize different species and fun facts about their cultural and ecological im
 portance\n.\nThis program takes place outdoors rain or shine\; please dres
 s accordingly.\nFree program. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a p
 arent/caregiver. Registration is required.\nThis program is part of TPL's\
 nOur Fragile Planet\nprogram series\, supported by Friends of Toronto Publ
 ic Library\, South Chapter.​
